This project builds on and includes code from SK8V, https://github.com/becaring/SK8V,
Copyright 2026 becaring, Apache License 2.0:
- gta/skate-gta/src/live/ (bounds.rs, clean.rs, grid.rs, level.rs, rails.rs, and locate.rs, a
  Rust port of host/src/physics_level.cpp); SK8V's live reader is adapted from Sol4ra's
  LS-Skate-LiveCollision.
- sk8v-patches/ are changes to SK8V.

The installer runs, but does not include, the Skate 3 Rust Engine's tools/asset_pipeline
(https://github.com/SK8-ENGINE/skate-3-rust-engine, Apache-2.0 for tools/asset_pipeline by
chasmlol's grant) from SK8V's release folder.

No Skate 3, skate., GTA V or other retail assets are included.
